    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magecraft: Spellbuilding</strong> is a deckbuilder with a focus on crafting your own spell cards and creating unique decks to take with you into the turn-based combat of the Dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you have control over the cards you start with, the randomized Dungeon layouts, enemy encounters, passive powers, and scrolls ensure that no two runs are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/549ee2cee68f7aa4de0b56bf6f20066b.avif?t=1755439640\" width=616 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/018e54a6480253ea663e10d1221171b7.webp?t=1755439640\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/c9181341e0e166882166514e070324ca.poster.avif?t=1755439640\" width=640 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/c9181341e0e166882166514e070324ca.webm?t=1755439640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/c9181341e0e166882166514e070324ca.mp4?t=1755439640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on enemy attacks, destroying them to keep yourself safe from harm - or take the hit and attack enemies directly to do as much damage as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/b7312fc66087ce002b047a797b3fd389.webp?t=1755439640\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/2414cc5e5447d72b6b313751f701e956.poster.avif?t=1755439640\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/2414cc5e5447d72b6b313751f701e956.webm?t=1755439640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/2414cc5e5447d72b6b313751f701e956.mp4?t=1755439640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through three distinct, themed dungeons, each with its own sets of enemies to defeat, powers and scrolls to collect, and events with with different choices to make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/91ef87807f24f868f99f1fd1eb32f826.webp?t=1755439640\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/323c201f06c367c872469f06c591fe0f.poster.avif?t=1755439640\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/323c201f06c367c872469f06c591fe0f.apng?t=1755439640\" class=\"bb_img\" width=663 height=390 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine <strong>over 50</strong> Sigils - with effects that deal damage, inflict debuffs, grant buffs, summon allies, and more - to craft custom spell cards for your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/74cc3fb3b87d7661b4bc5197ff6d0175.webp?t=1755439640\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/64c04449ae419f53c6391b59f4cc5944.poster.avif?t=1755439640\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/64c04449ae419f53c6391b59f4cc5944.apng?t=1755439640\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=250 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between a variety of appearances, color palettes, and unique Background powers when creating a character - and unlock new character colors to change into, as well as new characters with powerful abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/14cfce88f8bf50fdd63f7d3bfec7d384.webp?t=1755439640\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/c628dc6e3450dd5e72a8eb439728a2bc.poster.avif?t=1755439640\" width=586 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/c628dc6e3450dd5e72a8eb439728a2bc.webm?t=1755439640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/c628dc6e3450dd5e72a8eb439728a2bc.mp4?t=1755439640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Abyss is a separate  mode with randomized characters and starting decks, where unlike the main game, dying means starting a new run from the very beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magecraft: Spellbuilding</strong> is a deckbuilder with a focus on crafting your own spell cards and creating unique decks to take with you into the turn-based combat of the Dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you have control over the cards you start with, the randomized Dungeon layouts, enemy encounters, passive powers, and scrolls ensure that no two runs are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/549ee2cee68f7aa4de0b56bf6f20066b.avif?t=1755439640\" width=616 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/018e54a6480253ea663e10d1221171b7.webp?t=1755439640\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/c9181341e0e166882166514e070324ca.poster.avif?t=1755439640\" width=640 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/c9181341e0e166882166514e070324ca.webm?t=1755439640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641420/extras/c9181341e0e166882166514e070324ca.mp4?t=1755439640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on enemy attacks, destroying them to keep yourself safe from harm - or take the hit and attack enemies directly to do as much damage as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item